{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1526.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"691ded498a9137f244cebda50e2e2026e516cde69e702cd0a3a6b86da4aa4581","ja":"うん。番組で、お手紙を読むんだよね？\nでもたまき、まだぜんぜん書けなくて……。","zh":"嗯。是在节目里读信对吧？\n可是环还完全写不出来……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1526.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"fe98e6a2d557aa614701fc5b7078c53b26e511cfab980a2b0194dcbf9b2e7f8a","ja":"ばあちゃんに書きたいんだけど……\nどんなこと書いたらいいのかな～？","zh":"想写给奶奶……\n但写些什么好呢～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1526.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"064412faa29d433dd4915ebad779feb8296c86e7ff691d2297e06df5834f955c","ja":"そうねぇ……ちなみに環ちゃんのおばあちゃんって、\nどんな方なのかしら？","zh":"也是呢……顺便问一下，小环的奶奶\n是一位怎样的人呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1526.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"d4b5f8c078ceadb5bcbee02a76b2ef3eae7c7e84572e9cf4c1779d0fb24b0792","ja":"すっごく優しいの！　あとごはんもすごくおいしくて、\nたまきに、いろんなこと教えてくれるんだ！","zh":"人特别好！而且做的饭也非常好吃，\n还会教环好多好多东西呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1526.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"c2345600b26b1fb22c1bb384fa0aac183e7d30bdfe764def3a5961c01ec73fd8","ja":"うふふ♪\n環ちゃん、おばあちゃんが大好きなのね♪","zh":"呵呵♪\n环，你真的很喜欢老奶奶呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1526.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"c1d8b22cf101447f13f57ab69c7ef9ea66510fb80a918b731478abe4f2de423c","ja":"うん！　だからたまき、お休みの時、\nばあちゃんに会いに行けるのが楽しみなんだ♪　くふふ♪","zh":"嗯！所以环在放假的时候，\n很期待能去见奶奶呢♪　嘿嘿嘿♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1526.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"465f17aa88e16647fe3cff0a8a58f7fd43a3e87c402edfa590b41d773b17d3ba","ja":"いいわね♪　ねぇ、お手紙でも、\nそういう気持ちを書いてみるのはどうかしら？","zh":"真不错呢♪　那个，在信里\n试着写下这种心情怎么样？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1526.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"d68ec2b9ae044b54cac78746a94355b961d1764a1066c20bbad3f91da5142529","ja":"環ちゃんが今思ってること、したいこと……\nお手紙で伝えたら、喜んでもらえると思うわよ。","zh":"环现在心里想的事情、想做的事情……\n要是写在信里传达给对方，我想对方一定会很高兴的哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1526.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"e035b6332833046234e1fae26470302a686f302129ba0dfd9924023c8bd9e62b","ja":"ほんと？\nそれならたまき、いっぱい書けるぞ～！","zh":"真的吗？\n那样的话环能写好多好多哦～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
